  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey VRChat team,\nI would like to see the transparency mirror with the soon to be implemented portable mirror. The Transparency mirror has a way less performance impact then the full mirror or optimized mirror. I don't know why that is, but that's my general experience with it. And it makes it more fun to use in situations where you wanna see yourself but also the content behind, without making yourself be less visible.\nJust to be clear. I don't mean to make the mirror itself be transparent, but basically see yourself and still the content behind the mirror. So a see through mirror except avatars that get mirrored of course :)",
